    "An `absent` verdict is NOT proof of a fix. Some crash shapes carry no scannable token at the exact site \u2014 a native C-stack overflow (recursion), a data race (tsan) \u2014 so a fresh scan can read a still-unfixed bug as `absent`. Always read the file before concluding a bug is fixed.",
